      "title": "Consensus EPS estimates fall by 18%",
      "body": "The consensus outlook for earnings per share (EPS) in fiscal year 2027 has deteriorated. 2027 revenue forecast decreased from ₹15.6b to ₹15.1b. EPS estimate also fell from ₹26.00 per share to ₹21.28 per share. Net income forecast to grow 146% next year vs 21% growth forecast for Chemicals industry in India. Consensus price target down from ₹600 to ₹581. Share price fell 14% to ₹537 over the past week.",
