      "date": "2026-05-16T04:25:13.000Z",
      "title": "Earnings Miss: Archean Chemical Industries Limited Missed EPS By 30% And Analysts Are Revising Their Forecasts",
      "body": "There's been a notable change in appetite for Archean Chemical Industries Limited ( NSE:ACI ) shares in the week since...",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/stocks/in/materials/nse-aci/archean-chemical-industries-shares/news/earnings-miss-archean-chemical-industries-limited-missed-eps",
